{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49395","headline":"甘州遍 二 · 毛文锡","name":"甘州遍 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风紧，平碛雁行低，阵云齐。\n萧萧飒飒，边声四起，愁闻戍角与征鼙。\n青塚北，黑山西。\n沙飞聚散无定，往往路人迷。\n铁衣冷，战马血沾蹄。\n破蕃奚，凤皇诏下，步步蹑丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}